{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_gate","model_identifier":"elf_gate","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_gate\n\nElf gate: an arch of two tall marble pillars with carved wooden leaf boughs spanning over them and silver leaf tips.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 3 columns (128 x 48 units, 3.60 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -56..56, y 0..191, z -12..12 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 36, construction_0 18, construction_33 35, construction_66 42, ruined 6 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- pillars: two 24 x 158 x 24 boxes at x -44 / +44; the 72 u opening is walkable\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `elf_gate_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `elf_gate_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_elf_gate` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -20)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"plinth-1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-56.0,0.0,-12.0],"to":[-32.0,10.0,12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[112.0,204.0,136.0,214.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[136.0,204.0,160.0,214.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[112.0,204.0,136.0,214.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[136.0,204.0,160.0,214.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,96.0,24.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,96.0,24.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4c66cc16-09ed-5dc2-a1ed-ca3ff831be9f"},{"name":"pillar-1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.0,10.0,-8.0],"to":[-36.0,150.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,30.0,140.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[30.0,0.0,46.0,140.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,30.0,140.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30.0,0.0,46.0,140.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[184.0,0.0,200.0,16.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[184.0,0.0,200.0,16.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0e613fa9-b1a1-5644-9315-57d004097ce2"},{"name":"flute-10","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.4,14.0,-6.0],"to":[-52.0,146.0,-5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[62.6,0.0,63.0,132.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[63.0,0.0,64.0,132.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[62.6,0.0,63.0,132.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[63.0,0.0,64.0,132.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[214.6,251.0,215.0,252.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[214.6,251.0,215.0,252.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"58aff612-b0c2-5642-b547-4b01f1e5f12e"},{"name":"flute-11","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.